Add an Info (ⓘ) icon next to the Application field in the PAAM Conflict section. When the user clicks the info icon, a modal dialog should open displaying additional information about the selected application and its PAAM conflict details. The modal should be read-only and should help users understand the conflict without navigating away from the current page.


An Info (ⓘ) icon is displayed next to the Application name in the PAAM Conflict section.
The icon is visible only when an application record exists.
Clicking the Info icon opens a Salesforce Lightning modal.
The modal displays the required PAAM conflict information (content to be provided by the business).
The modal is read-only.
The modal contains a Close (X) button and can also be closed by clicking the Close button or pressing the Esc key.
Opening and closing the modal does not refresh the page or lose any user-entered data.
The feature works in supported browsers and follows Salesforce Lightning Design System (SLDS) guidelines.
